sim2sim Panda planning helpers (plan.py)

Parts of plan.py are adapted from RoboSimStudio
(https://github.com/robosimstudio/robosimstudio, commit d474a18b0b70c8f8fae3bbd8ce43a8456e57969b),
Copyright 2026 Kaiyuan Chen, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (a copy is in LICENSE beside
this file; also https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

Adapted algorithms, rewritten for numpy and MuJoCo (no RoboSimStudio code or dependency is included):
  Panda.grasp, _basis, _score  - robosimstudio/solvers/grasp/antipodal.py, robosimstudio_policy_agent/grasp_tools.py
  Panda.linear                 - robosimstudio/solvers/ik/solver.py (plan_line), robosimstudio/solvers/ik/arm_ik.py
                                 (plan_cartesian), robosimstudio_policy_agent/motion_tools.py (plan_linear)
  Panda.clearance              - robosimstudio/core/probes/clearance.py
Changes: surface points are sampled from MuJoCo collision primitives and meshes, pad and approach clearance use
MuJoCo collision of the whole Panda model, and grasp and pregrasp poses are validated by inverse kinematics.
